{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836978",
      "title": "Deleting Data (via DELETE HTTP Requests)",
      "sourceHash": "53dd9b6b73b57a5e07a171c7021c45f701f9a5b94c6c06c1d8f7161591085cb3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.18,
          "en": "Now, in this application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 6.18,
          "en": "selecting places is not the only way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.18,
          "end": 8.43,
          "en": "of updating our places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.43,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "Instead, we can also get rid of places we picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 15.27,
          "en": "by again clicking on them in our selected box here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.27,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "And then here, I can clear a place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "At the moment, though, this is ignored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "The place will still be part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "of my user-places.json file on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 28.86,
          "en": "so it will not be cleared there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.86,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "And how would it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "We're not sending any request to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 34.983,
          "en": "if the place should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "But we can now easily change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 40.699,
          "en": "In the app JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.699,
          "end": 43.53,
          "en": "in the handleRemovePlace function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 46.11,
          "en": "we can also send the request to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.11,
          "end": 47.523,
          "en": "to get rid of the place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "For this, we can turn this into a async function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 56.91,
          "en": "And I actually already did this for you here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.91,
          "end": 59.82,
          "en": "And then we can again perform optimistic updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.82,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "by first updating the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 64.383,
          "en": "and then sending an http request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 69.72,
          "en": "For this, we can again call updateUserPlaces here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 73.71000000000001,
          "en": "and send our updated places to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.71000000000001,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "for which I'll use the userPlaces state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "call filter, and then filter out the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "that has the same ID as the selected place I'm getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "or I currently selected before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 89.373,
          "en": "which is stored in my ref here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 92.13,
          "en": "So I'm using the same logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.13,
          "end": 94.68299999999999,
          "en": "as I did here for updating the state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 99.513,
          "en": "And we can now await this before we then proceed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 104.00999999999999,
          "en": "Now, since I'm using this userPlaces state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "here inside of handleRemovePlace,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 109.25999999999999,
          "en": "we also should add this as a dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.25999999999999,
          "end": 112.05,
          "en": "to the useCallBack dependencies array, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.05,
          "end": 115.059,
          "en": "to make sure that this function is indeed recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.059,
          "end": 118.14,
          "en": "if the userPlaces state changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.14,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "Which is crucial to ensure that we are sending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 125.31,
          "en": "the right updated places array to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.31,
          "end": 128.34,
          "en": "Now of course, just as before, this could fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "So I wanna wrap this with try catch again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 135.15,
          "en": "And just as before, if it does fail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.15,
          "end": 137.16,
          "en": "I wanna roll back my change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.16,
          "end": 139.443,
          "en": "and show an error message to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 144.87,
          "en": "So here I wanna set userPlaces equal to the old userPlaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.87,
          "end": 148.293,
          "en": "before they were updated to roll back the change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "And we can set our ErrorUpdatingPlaces state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "to an object where we have this message property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "which is equal to error.message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 164.13,
          "en": "or as a fallback, failed to delete place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.13,
          "end": 165.213,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.88,
          "end": 169.65,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.65,
          "end": 173.61,
          "en": "if I open this and delete a place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.61,
          "end": 176.76,
          "en": "you see that seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.76,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "This request was sent to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 182.55,
          "en": "and if on the other hand, I force an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.55,
          "end": 184.95,
          "en": "by again adding all my S's here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.95,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "though I'll only save that after I added at least one place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 192.003,
          "en": "but now if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 196.26,
          "en": "and I then go back and try to delete that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 199.383,
          "en": "you see I got that error and the change is rolled back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.69,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "So, that's working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 205.07999999999998,
          "en": "and I'll therefore get rid of those places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.07999999999998,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "and hence, the last remaining piece",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 210.21,
          "en": "that needs to be added to this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.21,
          "end": 212.64,
          "en": "is of course the logic to fetch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "those user places when the app loads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 218.13,
          "en": "Because that's currently not happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.13,
          "end": 221.19299999999998,
          "en": "We're never fetching those user places.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}